{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-14","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2011,"subject":"chemistry","number":14,"points":2,"unitId":"coordination","unitLabel":"배위화학","topic":"착이온·리간드·팔면체","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["coordination","bonding"],"stem":"다음은 두 쌍의 정팔면체 전이 금속 착이온의 홀전자 수를 비교한 \n것이다.\n◦[MnCl6]3−은 [Mn(CN)6]3−보다 홀전자가 많다. \n◦[Fe(H2O)6]3+은 [Fe(CN)6]3−보다 홀전자가 많다. \n위의 4가지 착이온과 3가지 리간드에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 \n<보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은? \n<보 기>\nㄱ. CN −이 가장 강한 장 리간드이다.\nㄴ. 홀전자가 가장 적은 것은 [Mn(CN)6]3−이다.\nㄷ. 상자성이 가장 큰 것은 [Fe(H2O)6]3+이다. ","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t011"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]}],"answer":3,"acceptedAnswers":[3],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":129,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,46.103,310.4,51.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-14/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":211,"height":24,"region":0,"bbox":[41.48,110.503,84.4,9.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-14/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":776,"height":207,"region":0,"bbox":[14.68,157.703,310.4,82.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t007","t008","t009","t010"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2011-meet-science2-14/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":7,"sourceRect":[430.12,153.497,759.1,443.302],"width":328.98,"height":289.805,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.68,46.103,310.4,51.6],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[41.48,110.503,84.4,9.6],"section":"stem"},{"t